k, Garden Pavilion, Outdoor Gym, Beach Volleyball Court, Party Terrace, Relaxation Lounge, Rock Climbing Wall, Play Lounge, Multi-purpose Lawn, Kids Play Village, Family Pavilion,", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "bb025954-90b7-4d20-947b-5691edda512e", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 13, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "1. Arrival Sculpture\\n5. Vertical Garden\\n7. Forest Walk\\n8. Walking Track\\n9. Garden Pavilion\\n10. Outdoor Gym\\n11. Beach Volleyball Court\\n12. Party Terrace\\n13. Relaxation Lounge\\n14. Rock Climbing Wall\\n15. Play Lounge\\n16. Multi-purpose Lawn\\n17. Kids Play Village\\n18. Family Pavilion\\n19. Lap Pool\\n20. Kids Pool\\n21. Jacuzzi\\n22. Water Wall\\n23. Pool Deck\\n24. Pool Cabanas\\n25. Alfresco Dining\\n26. Viewing Deck\\n27. Children's Play Area\\n28. Yoga Pavilion\\n29. Dining Pavilion\\n30. Toddler's Play Pod\\n31. Pet's Corn"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "The city's best amenities", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "af6b0d5a-3e59-46cb-922d-8c2ff107ba9a", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 17, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "THE CITY'S BEST AMENITIES."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "gardens, outdoor lounge area, poolside, private cabanas", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "de0ac4fc-de1b-4a8c-961a-2bd57f851c21", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 19, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Narang PrivadoΓÇÖs gardens lead into the heart of the community: the clubhouses. The Banquet Room is spread over 2 levels with an additional outdoor lounge area. The caf├⌐ leads out onto the poolside, with its cantilevered bridge and private cabanas."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Vehicle free, 2-acre central green", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "a5ee1bb2-4207-40af-a835-c03112afed20", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 20, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Vehicle free, 2-acre central green"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Key outdoor amenities: Swimming pools which includes a lap pool, kids pool and jacuzzi, ChildrenΓÇÖs play area, Beach volleyball court, Padel court, Rock climbing wall, Walking and jogging path, Outdoor gym, Pets park", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "a5ee1bb2-4207-40af-a835-c03112afed20", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 20, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Key outdoor amenities ΓÇö Swimming pools which includes a lap pool, kids pool and jacuzzi ΓÇö ChildrenΓÇÖs play area ΓÇö Beach volleyball court ΓÇö Padel court ΓÇö Rock climbing wall ΓÇö Walking and jogging path ΓÇö Outdoor gym ΓÇö Pets park"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "urban resort experience, no cars visible, blended inside and outside, iconic New York-inspired tower elevation, large open canvas, distinctive landscape, clubhouse of style and elegance", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "ec004ca7-5cee-4ae3-a330-6094643184d4", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 50, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "The project aims to create an urban resort experience. From the moment you are dropped off at a resort and begin your journey there until you leave, there are no cars to be seen. Thus, the inside and outside have kind of blended together to create a very similar kind of motif. The elevation of the towers have been inspired by iconic buildings in New York... The project was a large, open canvas with a focus on creating a distinctive landscape based on pattern language... The theme of the clubhous"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "private garden or nature area", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "f1a15f7a-26e3-4112-a796-2c8439c8af34", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 3, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "AND ENTER YOUR OWN PRIVATE PARADISE."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "lush, forest-themed podium", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "8f6c28bd-01ef-4f40-83d6-8c98ae9c5972", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 5, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "A tree-lined pathway winds through this lush, forest-themed podium."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "pool", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "d44de2bf-3463-4297-9557-f5eecf262c64", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 7, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "The sound of lilting water relaxes poolside visitors."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "sprawling lawns, forested greens, interconnected pools, private cabanas, soothing waterwall", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "bbafe6e2-9103-4e73-8438-ce6bf5b2c8aa", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 15, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Narang Privado features an upper podium with sprawling lawns... The lower podium is a private oasis with interconnected pools. A bridge cantilevers over the water to access private cabanas and a soothing waterwall."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Yoga studio overlooking greens", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "adb2ebfd-46d7-4886-80c2-fc1a32c66b0e", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 25, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "YOGA STUDIO OVERLOOKING GREENS"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "natural sunlight and cross-ventilation, nearly 5-foot wide decks", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "660b125c-b051-49d5-a453-01001cd03d60", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "85c01012-45e7-434f-af0d-5bfa71c8f509", "pageNumber": 29