like too much greenery or too many amenities."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Herb garden, Reading garden, Viewing deck, Tree bosques, Maze garden, Meditation area, Sloped lawn", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "407ea65a-7f7c-4205-8bee-fbe20858e692", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 22, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "ΓÇó Herb garden ΓÇó Reading garden ΓÇó Viewing deck ΓÇó Tree bosques ΓÇó Maze garden ΓÇó Meditation area ΓÇó Sloped lawn"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Olympic sized swimming pool, Swimming pool with pool deck, Family pool, Toddler's pool, Gym with various fitness zones, Squash court, Fitness center, Multiple activity room, Yoga deck", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "45b7e874-8209-4841-9a15-57c231b1add5", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 23, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "AN OLYMPIC SIZED SWIMMING POOL. BECAUSE LIVING LARGE IS LIVING WELL.\\nACTIVE AMENITIES\\n...\\nEternia has state of the art swimming pools you and your loved ones can indulge in with time and freedom.\\nΓÇó Gym with various fitness zones ΓÇó Squash court ΓÇó Swimming pool with pool deck\\nΓÇó Family pool ΓÇó ToddlerΓÇÖs pool ΓÇó Fitness center ΓÇó Multiple activity room\\nΓÇó ChildrenΓÇÖs play area ΓÇó Yoga deck"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Spa, Poolside lounge cum caf├⌐, Function hall, Reception lounge, Music room, Event plaza", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "b74b6f80-d9ea-4a7e-aba3-e4a88f03ef65", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 24, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "ΓÇó Spa ΓÇó Poolside lounge cum caf├⌐ ΓÇó Function hall ΓÇó Reception lounge ΓÇó Music room ΓÇó Event plaza"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "70% open space ratio", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "c7380a4a-9d18-4f21-8434-1a4ac5850394", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 11, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "ΓÇó Open space: Optimal development ensures a 70% open space ratio for you."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "landscape design", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "7984b42f-c3ff-4c35-bef7-df7d2e926643", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 14, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "In Elevate at Khopoli or Pune, we want to positively impact lives through sculpted and functional landscape design that enhances quality of life for the residents of the township and the people visiting it."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Grand Central Park, Township Greens, Lake", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "0e6420be-7a47-48f9-81fd-354463c3700b", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 15, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "3. GRAND CENTRAL PARK, 7. TOWNSHIP GREENS, Situated on the banks of a serene lake (from legend and description)"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "ample cross ventilation, maximum natural light, increased energy efficiency", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "58d673c9-d2da-4d92-9bd2-91710a192521", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 26, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "From the interior design and the spatial arrangement of the towers, to the open spaces, facade design and window placement, every aspect of construction at Eternia has been carefully considered and thought through to ensure ample cross ventilation and a general sense of space and openness within the home. The residences here have been designed after a detailed analysis of the sun and shadow paths, which ensures that there is maximum natural light and increased energy efficiency."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "grand entrance, high ceilings, stunning design, luxurious ambiance, lobby", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "1f0528e5-1e98-49d0-a161-2db3bf30d3e8", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 27, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "A GRAND ENTRANCE THAT TRULY DOES JUSTICE TO THE GRAND LIFE INSIDE. Step into the world of infinite possibilities, with style. High ceilings, stunning design, a luxurious ambience, everything about the lobby in Iconia sets it apart from the rest."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "lush greens, wide open spaces, green hills, serene lake in the backyard", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "75a084ea-722e-41e9-b5ef-67aff60cb6f1", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 4, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "In downtown Thane, amid lush greens and wide open spaces... stunning facade, green hills on the horizon, a serene lake in the backyard."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Podium amenities, Leisure amenities, Active amenities, Lifestyle amenities, Township green amenities", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "bc16f291-d5a5-4669-978e-3455db04cf81", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 5, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Podium amenities | Leisure amenities | Active amenities | Lifestyle amenities | Township green amenities"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Central greens, vehicle-free podium, eco-deck", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "71a956cd-08d7-441f-92a8-0cf1d543cfdd", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "03ea7b8f-83a3-4ac5-a05f-1279cca48b7b", "pageNumber": 19, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "1. CENTRAL GREENS - 2.4 ACRES\\n3. VEHICLE-FREE PODIUM\\nECO-DECK MAXIMUM AMENITY AREA PER RESIDENT IN THANE."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Spacious apartments with decks", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "99978b95-1ae3-4136-b4e5-2824612a557e", "provider