385ced", "pageNumber": 13, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "At The Elements, every amenity is designed to bring balance into your daily life. From fitness zones and jogging tracks that keep you active, to children's play areas and open spaces that bring families together, and entertainment facilities for relaxation - there's something for everyone."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "landscaped greens", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "17eda259-ca24-41f5-9d3d-3e39ac138eeb", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "a96247cc-5697-4d30-957a-69ea25385ced", "pageNumber": 18, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Surrounded by greenery and amenities, our traffic-free podium is a secure, car-free environment where kids explore freely, elders enjoy peaceful walks, and families connect amidst landscaped greens."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "landscaped garden, green haven, open spaces", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "5e7cb353-4147-47d1-a780-f08042da2965", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "a96247cc-5697-4d30-957a-69ea25385ced", "pageNumber": 19, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "The adjoining landscaped garden offers a refreshing green haven where you can begin your mornings with calm, spend evenings in leisure, or simply pause to enjoy the serenity of open spaces."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Swimming Pool, Fitness Center, Yoga Area, Jogging Track, Recreational Garden, Power Back, Electric Sub-Station", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "8c62d719-38dd-4560-a596-5bb90146895c", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "a96247cc-5697-4d30-957a-69ea25385ced", "pageNumber": 24, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Swimming Pool\\nFitness Center\\nYoga Area\\nJogging Track\\nRecreational Garden\\nPower Back\\nElectric Sub-Station"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Video door phone, Next gen locks, 24x7 Security, CCTV monitoring, Central security control room, Security in the lobby, Controlled access, RFID