aff to handle all the visitors & guide you properly throughout the entire premises."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Branded High-speed Elevators", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "171a2ec8-0c39-4123-931b-c1633313a3f0", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "933c50cb-7b8c-43cd-97af-876a45a55b3e", "pageNumber": 5, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Branded High-speed Elevators\\nHigh speed elevators brought to you by the most renowned brands in the world to give you that seamless experience while moving to and fro!"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Swimming Pool, Kids Pool, Pool Deck with Sit-Out, Gymnasium, Multipurpose Hall, Club House", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "755135c3-8655-434c-9989-e44f7fac823d", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "933c50cb-7b8c-43cd-97af-876a45a55b3e", "pageNumber": 6, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Swimming Pool & Kids Pool\\nPool Deck with Sit-Out\\nGymnasium\\nMultipurpose Hall\\nClub House"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Multipurpose court, Amphitheatre, Kids play area, Sand pit, Grass cover", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "d5ca094a-d4de-4a60-b7a1-0bf736c6618d", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "933c50cb-7b8c-43cd-97af-876a45a55b3e", "pageNumber": 8, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Multipurpose Court\\nA multi-purpose court with varied sports avenues like basketball, tennis, cricket etc. and an amphitheatre area with a comfortable seating ambience where you can hang out with your friends, your family & be a part of community building events like plays, musicals etc. with your beloved neighbours.\\n\\nKids Play Area\\nA secure, well-fortified kids play area that ensures the safety of your children while allowing them to engage in fun playtime with other neighbouring tiny tots! With"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Walkway Path", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "219a628f-5eed-4b10-b933-ea71285913d5", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "93