odies, meandering pathways, beautiful garden view", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "5a1b3b28-26ec-456d-8179-e789e452963a", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 48, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Elegant 25- to 32-storey towers are embedded in greenery; so sensitively designed, that they seem as much a part of the landscape as the trees, waterbodies and meandering pathways. Choose from a range of residences, each designed to receive excellent natural lighting and command a beautiful garden view."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Large windows for ample natural light and air. Every apartment has a garden or river view.", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "d40933be-0b81-43f1-a8f6-ba5f342b945f", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 49, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "ΓÇó Large windows for ample natural light and air.\\nΓÇó Every apartment has a garden or river view."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "private garden", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "ca069c70-a979-4fe2-8e03-b83f4a83bbb2", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 50, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "FEW PEOPLE HAVE THE PRIVILEGE OF A PRIVATE GARDEN. YOU COULD BE ONE OF THEM."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "garden villas", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "ca069c70-a979-4fe2-8e03-b83f4a83bbb2", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 50, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Amara offers a limited-edition collection of garden villas"}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "State-of-the-art home automation systems with multiple functions", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "8087bdb1-31d5-4288-ac0f-4b9d5627dd66", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 51, "re