 "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 7, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Dominating the stunning Am─üra landscape, is a central belt of stepped gardens, running down the length of the entire neighbourhood, forming a lush green spine and flowing out into informal green expanses and gardens. Thousands of ancient trees, carefully preserved to retain the verdant beauty of the original habitat, offer you the unique charm of living in complete harmony with nature... this beautifully landscaped expanse is like a journey of self-discovery, with a host of experiences awaiting "}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "cricket field", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "c257d93e-3533-4099-923a-aec9b5b044a8", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 12, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "HEREΓÇÖS AN ENTIRE CRICKET FIELD TO GET BACK IN FORM."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "basketball court", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "a4a53722-2b41-4841-9f39-2a41d6622086", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 14, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "Shake up your exercise routine with a game of basketball."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "steam room", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "08d1c339-bd7d-411f-a17e-8e7e797b6448", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 15, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "The steam room: a relaxing way to sweat it out after a hard day at work."}, {"model": "gpt-4.1", "value": "Tree houses, tire swings, themed playgrounds", "source": "visual_model", "assetId": "7aef6f1b-6cd7-457c-8a78-fb5909729b0f", "provider": "azure_foundry", "documentId": "f5ca6aa3-0dd5-4457-9d24-80d69d867bce", "pageNumber": 22, "reviewState": "unreviewed", "evidenceText": "TREE HOUSES, TIRE SWINGS AND THEMED PLAYGROUNDS FOR THE CHILD IN YOU