d5612b2e-bece-4717-9287-9a48abeab853	2026-09-15 17:23:16.691867+00	2026-09-15 17:23:16.6924+00	3	3	EVERY NEIGHBOURHOOD HAS A CERTAIN RHYTHM. Some places lend themselves to pause, others to momentum. Rohan Adira takes shape within one such setting, where homes are lifted away from the everyday bustle, and shared spaces are allowed to open up and breathe. The development brings together three residential towers, rising above a landscaped realm that gently separates living from movement. Daily conveniences remain closer to the street, while homes are positioned higher, creating a clear distinction between arrival and retreat. Together, these layers shape an environment designed to feel biggerΓÇönot through scale, but through openness, clarity, and calm. This is where the story begins.	a5f686f1cf41ebffefb9d0783edacf93639fe5fb7053d703afb4d59ac0ddb3ce	105	{"0": 0.08697073, "2": 0.08697073, "5": 0.08697073, "8": 0.08697073, "9": 0.08697073, "19": 0.08697073, "42": 0.08697073, "45": 0.08697073, "50": 0.08697073, "55": 0.08697073, "58": 0.08697073, "59": 0.08697073, "61": 0.17394146, "63": 0.22694471, "64": 0.08697073, "69": 0.14725424, "83": 0.17394146, "86": 0.08697073, "91": 0.08697073, "110": 0.08697073, "113": 0.08697073, "118": 0.08697073, "123": 0.08697073, "132": 0.08697073, "143": 0.08697073, "146": 0.18251784, "150": 0.08697073, "155": 0.20753776, "156": 0.08697073, "157": 0.08697073, "163": 0.08697073, "168": 0.08697073, "173": 0.08697073, "176": 0.08697073, "185": 0.17394146, "187": 0.08697073, "191": 0.08697073, "201": 0.17394146, "216": 0.08697073, "222": 0.08697073, "224": 0.08697073, "227": 0.08697073, "233": 0.08697073, "241": 0.08697073, "246": 0.08697073, "247": 0.08697073, "253": 0.20753776, "263": 0.08697073, "269": 0.08697073, "280": 0.08697073, "282": 0.08697073, "286": 0.08697073, "289": 0.08697073, "290": 0.08697073, "291": 0.14725424, "294": 0.08697073, "297": 0.08697073, "299": 0.08697073, "301": 0.08697073, "308": 0.08697073, "317": 0.18251784, "3